      "id": "IAD901",
      "status": "Answered",
      "question": "Which evidence threshold makes a proposal eligible for a separate promotion review?",
      "answer": "Eligibility requires at least two reviewed findings from at least two independent projects, positive and negative evidence, at least one bound retrospective, cross-project assessment, compatibility, migration, rollback, tests, security, accessibility, documentation, and zero blocking findings. Eligibility is not promotion and a single project cannot establish a canonical preset.",
      "evidence": "Thorsten explicitly accepted the recommended IAD901 option on 2026-08-08 by authorising execution and correction of the complete proposed RAW-09 sequence."
    },
