      "id": "IAD902",
      "status": "Answered",
      "question": "Which repository receives each proposal?",
      "answer": "The first target is hindermath/home-baseline. github/spec-kit is permitted only after community-general applicability is proven and only through the required serial single-item queue.",
      "evidence": "Thorsten explicitly accepted the recommended IAD902 option on 2026-08-08 by authorising execution and correction of the complete proposed RAW-09 sequence."
